.th MAS I 1/26/76
.sh NAME
mas \*- Motorola M6800 assembler
.sh SYNOPSIS
.bd mas
name [-l[:lname]] [-o[:oname]] name ...
.sh DESCRIPTION
.it Mas
assembles the concatenation of the specified files.
.s3
The object file, in Mikbug loader format, is left in the file
.it oname
if it is supplied and otherwise in
.it "m.out"
and the listing in the file
.it lname
or in
.it "m.lst"
if no name is given with `-l'.
If `-l' is omitted no listing is produced and
a `-o' without a name results in no object.
.sh FILES
/lib/mas2		pass 2 of the assembler
.br
/tmp/motm?.[0-5]	temporary
.br
m.out			object
.br
m.lst			listing
.sh "SEE ALSO"
`Motorola M6800 Microprocessor Programming Manual'.
.br
`UNIX Motorola M6800 Assembler Reference Manual'.
.sh DIAGNOSTICS
When syntatic or semantic errors occur the line-number
and filename in which it occurred is output with a
self-explanatory description of the error.
Errors in pass 1 cause cancellation of pass 2.
.sh BUGS
Symbol table overflow is not checked.
